- **Re-verify the allow-list at 14:00Z.** It is the measurement above; if a page was linked or added since, the 4th test fails by design. Fix the list, do not delete the test.
- **Do not substitute `docs:build` for this suite** (card constraint). `ignoreDeadLinks: true` means the build passes precisely on the bug this test catches.
